# PROPOSED owners file for CUDApp. INACTIVE: GitHub reads CODEOWNERS only from
# .github/, the repository root or docs/, so this file under docs/review/ has no effect.
# Activation is Drake's decision: copy it to .github/CODEOWNERS after the human reviewers
# he chooses accept, and replace each placeholder team with their GitHub logins.
# Until then every path keeps the agent rule in docs/REVIEWING.md section 1 (non-author
# approval, fresh-clone gates, --match-head-commit).
#
# Placeholders (not real GitHub teams yet):
#   @aien-dev/gpu-core-reviewers   experienced GPU/compiler engineers (at least two)
#   @aien-dev/ip-review            the IP lawyer Drake engages (provenance and licence files)
#   @drakestapleton                owner; final say on licence and gate changes

# Default: owner.
*                                   @drakestapleton

# Core path 1: machine-code encoders, launch descriptors and code objects.
